# Reviewed, accepted-risk findings only - per docs/adr/0010, HIGH/CRITICAL
# with no upstream fix get a justified entry here, not a loosened gate.
# Re-evaluate whenever cosign's pinned version (Dockerfile, currently
# v3.1.3 - verified as the actual latest release, not just assumed) or the
# base image changes: if either has since shipped a fix, remove the
# matching entry and let a rebuild resolve it instead.

# --- base OS (python:3.12-slim) - same package family as, and same
# reasoning as, services/gateway/.trivyignore: base-OS packages in a code
# path this container (Python + a single cosign subprocess call, non-root,
# no mount/cgroup capabilities) never exercises.
